 =?UTF-8?q?=E9=92=A9=E5=AD=90=EF=BC=9AExecutorStart=20(DML=20=E8=AF=BB?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E8=B7=AF=E5=BE=84=20MAC)=20+=20ProcessUtility=20(DDL=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E8=A7=92=E8=89=B2=E6=A3=80=E6=9F=A5)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- jt_sec_hooks.c: ExecutorStart_hook 校验 rtable 中表级标签（SECURITY LABEL
  FOR 'jt'，provider='jt'，PG seclabel 基础设施）；ProcessUtility_hook 检查
  CREATE/DROP/ALTER 角色权限
- jt_sec_hooks_init() 在 PostgresMain 初始化时安装钩子
- MAC off 时全部跳过（阶段 0 兼容）
